      "note_title": "Note 2 - Operating Leases and Commitments",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks_in_note": 1,
      "text": "[TechVanguard Software Inc. | FY2024 | Note 2 - Operating Leases and Commitments]\n\nNote 2 - Operating Leases and Commitments\nThe Company leases office facilities and data center capacity under non-cancelable operating leases expiring at various dates through 2029. As of\nDecember 31, 2024, operating lease liabilities were USD 8.4 million with a weighted-average remaining lease term of 4.2 years and a discount rate of\n5.5%. Future minimum lease obligations are USD 2.5 million in 2025, USD 2.2 million in 2026, and USD 3.7 million thereafter.",
      "character_count": 544,
      "estimated_tokens": 136,
