      "fiscal_period": "FY2024",
      "note_number": "3",
      "note_title": "Note 3 - Credit Facilities and Long-Term Debt",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks_in_note": 1,
      "text": "[TechVanguard Software Inc. | FY2024 | Note 3 - Credit Facilities and Long-Term Debt]\n\nNote 3 - Credit Facilities and Long-Term Debt\nAs of December 31, 2024, the Company maintained a senior secured term loan facility with an outstanding principal of USD 30.0 million bearing\ninterest at Term SOFR plus 2.25%. The credit agreement contains financial covenants requiring maintenance of a minimum fixed charge coverage\nratio of 1.25x and maximum leverage ratio of 2.75x. The Company was in full compliance with all covenants.",
