      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks_in_note": 1,
      "text": "[TechVanguard Software Inc. | FY2024 | Note 4 - Stock-Based Compensation]\n\nNote 4 - Stock-Based Compensation\nThe Company recognized stock-based compensation expense of USD 4.8 million for the year ended December 31, 2024. Restricted stock units\n(RSUs) vest over a four-year period with a 25% cliff at one year and quarterly vesting thereafter. Unrecognized compensation expense related to\nunvested awards was USD 7.2 million, expected to be recognized over 2.6 years.",
